{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Review DVLA\u2019s performance & processes, increase funding & create governing body",
        "additional_details": "- Ensure all forms are available to download or complete online & all payments can be submitted online. \r\n- Ensure enquiries & complaints are resolved in no more than 14 days.\r\n- Review the information given by staff and the computer and phone systems.\r\n- Set new standards for the medical exams of High Risk Offenders & all applicants so all medical professionals carry out the same exam.\r\n- Create a new Governing Body specifically to oversee the DVLA \r\n- Increase funding to the DVLA",
        "background": "We want the government to conduct a review of the DVLA's performance and processes to make sure everyone is treated fairly & equally.",
